Your task is to create a function that updates the tablist based on the actions performed by players. The function should take a list of actions as input and update the tablist accordingly. Each action can be one of the following types:
- `Add(players)`: Add the specified players to the tablist.
- `Remove(players)`: Remove the specified players from the tablist.

The tablist is represented as a set of unique player UUIDs. When adding players to the tablist, their UUIDs should be inserted into the set. When removing players from the tablist, their UUIDs should be removed from the set.

